{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d1c3","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a07039-8c36-7981-972e-5e4ed62aa495"},"sequence":1852,"recorded_at":1780531400003699,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"58f5c997-17a5-45b9-a711-d639aa7cbef7","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"58f5c997-17a5-45b9-a711-d639aa7cbef7","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"58f5c997-17a5-45b9-a711-d639aa7cbef7"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Round-6 verdict answered, ready for review.\n\nF1 — the three switch-shaped vocabularies are package-level maps now (`responseMembers`, `profileNames`, `statusStates` in [protocol.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-3jqsx1/worktree/internal/provhost/protocol.go), [profile.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-3jqsx1/worktree/internal/provhost/profile.go), [status.go](/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-3jqsx1/worktree/internal/provhost/status.go)), each with a pinned-document derivation, census registration (19→22), and an entry-point refusal row. `TestAllProductionSwitchesAreClassified` fails on any new switch, and the \"by construction\" header now states the derived shapes plus that guard. Each `bogus` widening dies three ways (derivation, census subtest, entry point), restores sha256-verified.\n\nF2 — `ExecRunner` had two races: `writeErr` returned before stdout was considered (EPIPE discarding valid frames), and a deeper one I found by driving `Run` directly — `Wait` closes `StdoutPipe` read ends mid-drain (`read |0: file already closed`, 2/20 iters), which is what misclassified the `exit 3` fixture. Fixed per the file's own comments (frame governs; write/close/wait surface only with empty stdout and no exit) with drains over `Run`-owned `os.Pipe` pairs. Both new loop tests (200 valid-frame, 50 crash) fail on the pre-fix runner and pass post-fix.\n\nFlake — 30/30 provhost runs green post-fix; LOGBOOK 0926 \"15/15 green\" corrected to a single observation, round-6 findings carried in a new 0935 entry. Gates: build, vet, windows vet, gofmt, full module (15 pkgs), race green; coverage 86.5→86.0. Left uncommitted; artifact `TASK-260830-32jeti_round7-rework.md` attached; handed off to review.","reason":null}}
